  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.02",
    "summary": "Use it in any phase, right after a friendly unit or model makes an [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), Charge, Damage, [Hazard](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls), [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), [Save](vsdata:core-rule/save-rolls) or [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) roll, or rolls for how many attacks a weapon gets. Pick that unit or model and roll again. When several dice were thrown, you choose a single die to reroll; [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step) are the exception and get rerolled completely. Like any Stratagem, it can be used only [once in a phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
